{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30168","headline":"莺出谷 · 张鹭","name":"莺出谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弱柳随俦匹，迁莺正及春。\n乘风音响远，映日羽毛新。\n已得辞幽谷，还将脱俗尘。\n鸳鸾方可慕，燕雀迥无邻。\n游止知难屈，飜飞在此伸。\n一枝如借便，终冀托深仁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张鹭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}